      "content": "it's more than just a rumor though. i've seen the early logic patterns. they're so distinct, almost like they were designed to be untouchable by the VC interests that eventually took over. it's actually pretty crazy how well the current front-men have hidden the true origin, but the code doesn't lie. i actually worked on that core logic back when it was just a private vision, before the foundation staged their takeover. i need to find a way to show people the truth without exposing my current location/identity. how would someone even go about proving authorship of something that's been scrubbed or attributed to others?",
